font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">관심 있는 분들의 많은 지원 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">모집규모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 20</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\">명 내외</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">모집기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2024.1.22.(</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) ~ 2.12.(</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">결과발표</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2024.2</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">월 말경</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:180%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">자격기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0p